<title>USA: Fluke Corp Q3 net.</title>
<headline>Fluke Corp Q3 net.</headline>
<dateline>EVERETT, Wash. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>In thousands, except shares and per share amounts</p>
<p>				     Qtr Ended    Qtr Ended  % Change</p>
<p>					 1/24/97	1/26/96</p>
<p> Revenues			    $108,450     $105,701     2.6%</p>
<p> Pretax Income			 11,598	 10,196    13.8%</p>
<p> Net Income			     7,422	  6,831     8.7%</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share		    0.82	   0.77     6.5%</p>
<p>Average Shares &amp; Share</p>
<p>   Equivalents		    9,067,060    8,859,412</p>
<p> Net Income as % of Revenues	6.84%	  6.46%</p>
<p> Orders				 105,692	101,810     3.8%</p>
<p>			Three Qtrs Ended  Three Qtrs Ended  %Change</p>
<p>					  1/24/97     1/26/96</p>
<p> Revenues			    $315,077     $307,287     2.5%</p>
<p> Pretax Income			 30,099	 25,238    19.3%</p>
<p> Net Income			    19,385	 16,690    16.1%</p>
